1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,000
And today...

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Now that my arms are better, I gotta work real hard and make up for lost time!

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
It looks like peace has finally returned to the Black Bull's hideout.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Kinda boring with nothing going on around here, don't you think?

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
I could get used to this.

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Then, a lone mage stepped in and spoiled the tranquility.

10
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Listen up!

11
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
He was known as the Captain of the Black Bulls.

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
And for some reason, he wore a hoppy coat.

13
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
There's a big festival going on today.

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Festival?

15
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Festival?

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Festival?

17
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Festival?

18
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:50,980
I'll see you next time.

19
00:01:51,000 --> 00:02:20,980
I'll see you next time.

20
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:50,980
I'll see you next time.

21
00:02:50,980 --> 00:02:53,020
Tell me more about this big festival!

22
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,380
Well, I can tell you one thing, Osta.

23
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:56,780
It's pretty freaking awesome!

24
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,040
Does that help?

25
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:59,180
Yeah, totally!

26
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:00,860
Wait, I still don't understand!

27
00:03:01,980 --> 00:03:03,360
That doesn't help at all.

28
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:07,220
You, tell us what this festival is and be as detailed as you can.

29
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:08,080
Me?

30
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,200
Oh, right, sure.

31
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:10,880
I'm your superior.

32
00:03:11,780 --> 00:03:16,460
As you know, Magic Knight squads receive stars as a reward for good performance.

33
00:03:16,820 --> 00:03:20,100
And we compete with all the usual suspects to see who can get the most.

34
00:03:21,380 --> 00:03:27,260
This festival is where they announce the total number of stars distributed over the past year and crown the winning squad.

35
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:27,880
Oh!

36
00:03:28,540 --> 00:03:29,740
Let's aim for the top!

37
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:34,900
Except our squad does nothing but cause trouble, which means we're always in a race for dead last.

38
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:35,600
No.

39
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:39,420
We're in last by a mile.

40
00:03:39,900 --> 00:03:41,860
No one else has negative stars.

41
00:03:42,140 --> 00:03:42,600
Really?

42
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:45,080
Come on, how terrible can we be?

43
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:52,060
As I was saying, the festival is attended and enjoyed by citizens all over the Clover Kingdom as the largest public event of its kind.

44
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:53,080
It's called...

45
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:57,260
The Star Festival.

46
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,560
Woo-hoo!

47
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:01,260
Nice one, Bot!

48
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:02,640
This is nuts!

49
00:04:02,860 --> 00:04:04,780
I've never seen him get this fired up!

50
